OL,3,GNEWSAOh what a beauty! How the
OL,4,AMangelwurzel is making a comeback
OL,5,
OL,6,FA forgotten vegetable once viewed as
OL,7,Fpeasant or livestock food is enjoying
OL,8,Fan unlikely comeback in Somerset as a
OL,9,Ffestival in its honour takes place this
OL,10,Fweekend.
OL,12,FMore than 100 people across seven
OL,13,Fvillages between Glastonbury and
OL,14,FBridgwater are now growing
OL,15,Fmangelwurzels, the bright red root crop
OL,16,Fcrossed between beetroot, sugar beet
OL,17,Fand chard.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
