OL,3,GNEWSAOh what a beauty! How the
OL,4,AMangelwurzel is making a comeback
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Great Polden Hills Mangelwurzel Day
OL,7,Fwill see vegetables judged in
OL,8,Fcategories like 'Biggest Girth', 'Best
OL,9,FLooking Legs', and looking 'Most like
OL,10,FDonald Trump'.
OL,12,FEvent founder Beverley Finnegan said:
OL,13,F"What started as a challenge between
OL,14,Ffriends to grow the biggest
OL,15,Fmangelwurzel has, eight months later,
OL,16,Fbecome a festival with hundreds of
OL,17,Flocals involved."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
